# This repository is public. It is a WHITELIST: everything is ignored unless it is re-included
# below, so the match data, the external datasets, feature caches, other models, submissions and
# any visualisation of the provided game can never be committed by accident.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/WRITEUP.md
!/LICENSE
!/LICENSE-challenge.txt
!/requirements.txt
!/requirements-extra.txt
!/*.py
!/possession_model_final.joblib

# official scorer and validator, as shipped by the challenge repository
!/evaluation/
/evaluation/reports/
/evaluation/scoreboard.csv
/evaluation/results/*.csv
!/evaluation/results/baseline_*.csv

# not part of the method: renders frames of the provided game (its output must never be published)
/visualize.py

# never, anywhere
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
